pi.github.com/users/ttyusupov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2019-07-11T16:29:29Z","updated_at":"2024-10-24T07:10:22Z","closed_at":"2019-07-11T17:31:39Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-13559](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-13559)\r\nThere is a code in `Tablet::OpenKeyValueTablet` which turns off auto compactions:\r\n```\r\nrocksdb_options.disable_auto_compactions = true;\r\nrocksdb_options.level0_slowdown_writes_trigger = std::numeric_limits<int>::max();\r\nrocksdb_options.level0_stop_writes_trigger = std::numeric_limits<int>::max();\r\n```\r\nand later it is supposed to be re-enabled in `TabletPeer::Start` by calling \r\n`tablet_->EnableCompactions`. In case tablet is truncated, `Tablet::Truncate` - it calls `OpenKeyValueTablet` which turns off auto compactions and since tablet peer is not restarted - compactions are not enabled after truncate.\n\n[DB-13559]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-13559?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","closed_by":{"login":"ttyusupov","id":903044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMzA0NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/903044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov","html_url":"https://github.com/ttyusupov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https:/